{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>深水埗發現受傷動物。今日（18日）凌晨1時許，兩名途人先後行經大埔道338號一個油站對開時，發現一隻野猴口吐白泡，於是報案求助和通知愛協，人員接獲通知到場，惟野猴爬樹離開。</p><figure><img alt=\"深水埗大埔道338號一個油站對開發現一隻野猴口吐白泡。（Google街景截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261018/1188359073288949760921530.jpeg/accu_mYzvHwhuzYyxIdPjIJCPA4H0gWtwZYS9sGWEvY\"/><figcaption>深水埗大埔道338號一個油站對開發現一隻野猴口吐白泡。（Google街景截圖）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-17T21:39:03.073999+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":126,"images":1,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-17T21:23:47+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-17T21:37:58.871279+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-17T21:37:58.871279+00:00","content_hash":"3328fc841abbe0ab7dd18ce255a6d2848c71c7e672c2e96db4573f654803d041","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}